{"c":[{"id":"cf173c783d21b3d2","sum":"Caret skills: JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/. Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 (launchd dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe, :3031, cli-darwin Mach-O holds TCC) has its own AX prompt, unaffected by Caret's grant. Inference last-N hard-fails. xcodeproj object IDs must be unique.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d8373d741af56a81","sum":"Caret skills: name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/ (not Apify SKILL.md). Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID and AX prompt; Caret's grant does not stop it. Debug menu shows truncated last-2 via history-debug; inference last-N hard-fails.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"25648c3d0b258189","sum":"Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/, not Apify's coding-agent SKILL.md; Apify is not a selected executor. Niko QA/Preflight (2026-09-19) used only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T185053Z-ae95c44f0be90de0","text":"Apify Agent Skills are coding-agent SKILL.md (MCP/CLI/Actors); Caret skills are name/description JSON under caret/skills/<action-id>/. Apify is not a selected Caret executor.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T185221Z-b9280ccda04db89b","text":"2026-09-19: Niko QA/Preflight in this repo today must use only cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh-fast or Gemini 3.8 Flash (Gemini not on the subagent allow-list).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"458043431cd4683f","sum":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 has its own Developer ID (screenpipe) and its own AX prompt; granting Caret Accessibility does not stop it. Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190218Z-3dcac55ddd67aa19","text":"Pinned screenpipe@0.4.50 is Developer ID identifier screenpipe, not Caret; it calls AXIsProcessTrustedWithOptions and retries while waiting. Granting Caret Accessibility does not stop its dialog.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T190435Z-bd82100fe9b9695e","text":"Caret Debug menu shows truncated last-2 windows/minutes/clipboard via history-debug CLI; last-N hard-fail stays for inference.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1dc8d7a171a0b9ab","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031 via the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary); its screen/AX preflights stayed false despite Settings. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources list breaks xcodebuild.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"73ecfa7fb5d9e38e","sum":"Caret runs screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031, exec'ing the cli-darwin Mach-O (TCC is that binary), not the npx shim; it logged screen=false accessibility=false and System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T190651Z-7c7ff0f30e9d0baa","text":"Caret-spawned screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 at 14:03 logged screen=false accessibility=false and retried VisionManager every 5s; System Settings ON did not flip those preflights.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T191856Z-e383776735c95605","text":"Caret starts screenpipe@0.4.50 as launchd job dev.caret.hackathon.screenpipe on :3031; exec the cli-darwin Mach-O, not npx/node shim. TCC is that binary.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"23edfb00e1d611eb","sum":"After PR #11 (main merged), README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording and the Debug last-2 preview. Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list stops xcodebuild opening the project.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192245Z-7c3e6304f151c521","text":"PR #11 merged main; README/productContext/techContext keep launchd Screenpipe wording plus Debug last-2 preview.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T192513Z-736b08c59f95f4f1","text":"Caret.xcodeproj object IDs must be unique; a FileRef in a Sources files list makes xcodebuild unable to open the project","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"357d6a64e95bbcfa","sum":"v1: xcodeproj Info.plist B100…62 (57 TabCompletions); Screenpipe /search needs Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY + X-Screenpipe-Client: api; vercel key is a bare token file; make install needs packages/keytype; Translate reads selection or clipboard, not the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"eb97d3ea4b169abf","sum":"Caret.xcodeproj Info.plist is B100…62 (57 is TabCompletions); Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search needs Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; router tests advance a fake clock past the 10 s backoff.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8b70e773b2fa893f","sum":"Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62, B100…57 is TabCompletions; never give Info.plist 57. Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY (/health is open); Caret _api sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY only if set.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192920Z-0329343e8c4345de","text":"Current Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62; B100…57 is TabCompletions. Do not assign Info.plist 57.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193615Z-bae439ab3f2c08e5","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY; /health is open. Caret _api only sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY if set.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0394a3f3d78f5601","sum":"Router tests advance a fake clock past the 10 s failure backoff; Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api with the token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or screenpipe's own.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T193745Z-b26ffd587de72a56","text":"Router backs off RouterConfig.failure_backoff_seconds (10s) after a failed evaluation; router tests advance a fake clock rather than expecting an immediate retry. Provider presets patch their own module's post_json in tests.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193825Z-36390ce7b0d562a4","text":"Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or pinned screenpipe auth token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8267e3a9d1defc9a","sum":"v1 keys and skills: vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file; make install needs packages/keytype; Debug last-N skips Caret Debug, inference last_n_windows does not; Translate reads a selection or the clipboard, never the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0077b084d2383d9f","sum":"Keys and builds: vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (CoreLaunchSettings envFile holds AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY/GROQ_API_KEY as KEY=value); make install needs the packages/keytype checkout or xcodebuild resolve exits 74.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T214418Z-9e6967d283b5b427","text":"vercel-api-gateway-key is a bare token file (not KEY=value); CoreLaunchSettings envFile is the KV path for AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY / GROQ_API_KEY.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T214943Z-7cb27000d0b12580","text":"make install requires packages/keytype checkout (CompletionUI); empty submodule dir makes xcodebuild resolve fail with 74","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f8e28d7f83c0c10b","sum":"v1 gateway skills: Debug last-N skips the Caret Debug window, inference last_n_windows does not; Translate reads a live selection or the clipboard, never the caret line.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T215111Z-04557dfeed12d63f","text":"Debug last-N windows skip title Caret Debug (matches showDebugWindow); inference last_n_windows does not skip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T215901Z-031ebbfd04136a32","text":"Translate uses a live non-empty selection or the clipboard; it never uses the caret line. Other gateway skills still do.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
